    "summary": "Slip catalogue:\r\nSnuff tube formed of a joint of bamboo browned all over and closed at one end. At the other end the membrane is pierced by a small circular aperture. Ornamented by vertical compartments of zig-zag alternating with bands of straight vertical lines, separated from each other by horizontal bands of similar design; in each case the pattern is left in relief by cutting away the background. Below the perforated end is a broad band of brass wire binding.",
